<catalogue name="Imperium - Astra Militarum" id="8d56-3914-ca1f-aaf3" authorContact="Centuria Astartes Discord, ask for AHeras or Lord Oscar." authorName="A. Heras, Lord Oscar" authorUrl="Centuria Astartes Discord" battleScribeVersion="2.03" gameSystemId="5b78-3a13-0882-b019" gameSystemRevision="4" library="false" revision="1" type="catalogue" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <readme>Additional reference data obtained from Wahapedia, https://wahapedia.ru/</readme>
  <categoryEntries>
    <categoryEntry name="Regiment" id="3aa8-21df-b483-57dd" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Vox Range" id="8700-6a0e-9446-b750" hidden="true" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <comment>Infantry</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This unit is considered to be in VOX RANGE of an OFFICER unit if:
- Is within 6&quot; of that OFFICER unit.
- Is within 6&quot; of an INFANTRY unit already in VOX RANGE and within 12&quot; of that OFFICER squad.
- Is within 24&quot; of that OFFICER squad and the unit is equiped with a VOX-CASTER.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="3d52-fccf-10c0-3fae" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                    <condition childId="3d52-fccf-10c0-3fae" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Vox Range" id="6bbd-0772-784f-494e" hidden="true" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <comment>Vehicle</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This unit is considered to be in VOX RANGE of an OFFICER unit if:
- Is within 36&quot; of that OFFICER unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="c8fd-783f-3230-493e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                    <condition childId="c8fd-783f-3230-493e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Camo Cloak" id="b538-4c52-3bb5-e550" hidden="true" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a ranged attack is made against this unit, a hit roll of 1-3 for that attack fails. Substract 1 from that attack&apos;s hit roll.
- Each time a ranged attack is allocated to a model in this unit while it is receiving the benefits of cover, add an additional 1 to any armour saving throw made against that attack.
- Enemy models cannot target a model in this unit with ranged attacks unless they are within 18&quot; of it.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditionGroups>
                    <conditionGroup type="or">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition childId="3d52-fccf-10c0-3fae" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                        <condition childId="3d52-fccf-10c0-3fae" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                      </conditions>
                    </conditionGroup>
                  </conditionGroups>
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="4c5e-f10c-2136-ee1f" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Brutal Strength" id="3b7f-2a80-f636-1a0c" hidden="true" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- REGIMENT INFANTRY suffers no penalty to moving and firing heavy weapons.
- When rolling the number of Attacks with a Flame Weapon for a REGIMENT model, you can roll an additional dice and discard one of the results.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditionGroups>
                    <conditionGroup type="or">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition childId="3d52-fccf-10c0-3fae" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                        <condition childId="3d52-fccf-10c0-3fae" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                      </conditions>
                    </conditionGroup>
                  </conditionGroups>
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="91b9-249a-ace9-c29f" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Death from Above" id="b379-b686-9bba-d84e" hidden="true" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">During deployment, if every model in this unit has this ability, then you can set up this unit high in the skies instead of setting it up on the battlefield. If you do, then in the Reinforcements step of one of your Movement phases you can set up this unit anywhere on the battlefield that is more than D3+6&quot; away from enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditionGroups>
                    <conditionGroup type="or">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition childId="3d52-fccf-10c0-3fae" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                        <condition childId="3d52-fccf-10c0-3fae" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                      </conditions>
                    </conditionGroup>
                    <conditionGroup type="or">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition childId="0e21-4576-ab47-5adf" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1"/>
                        <condition childId="901d-9cf4-c32e-cdbf" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1"/>
                      </conditions>
                    </conditionGroup>
                  </conditionGroups>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Integrated Comunications" id="dbf9-9543-0a39-1cde" hidden="true" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- REGIMENT Units are always considered to be in range of orders.
- REGIMENT Units are always considered to be within range of the aura abilities of any friendly REGIMENT OFFICERS.
Multiple instances of the same ability do not stack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="a881-2506-2f81-760f" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Rough Terrain Experts" id="c198-08e8-0136-181c" hidden="true" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">REGIMENT INFANTRY and REGIMENT RECON Ignore penality to move trough difficult terrain.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditionGroups>
                    <conditionGroup type="or">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition childId="e1eb-8fe4-62d2-dd17" childName="Recon" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                        <condition childId="3d52-fccf-10c0-3fae" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
