          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When rolling the number of Attacks with a Flame Weapon for a REGIMENT model, you can roll an additional dice and discard one of the results.</characteristic>
