            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each unmodified Hit roll of 5+ from an attack of Strength 6 or less made by a &lt;REGIMENT&gt; VEHICLE model counts as an additional hit.</characteristic>
