          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each model destroyed by an attack made by a REGIMENT INFANTRY or REGIMENT RECON model is treated as 2 destroyed models in the following Morale phase.</characteristic>
