        <profile name="Blessed defenders" id="bfcc-f72f-6db0-e7fb" hidden="true" selectable="true" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a REGIMENT INFANTRY or REGIMENT CAVALRY model would lose a wound as the result of a mortal wound, roll a D6, on a 5+, the wound is not lost.
- REGIMENT INFANTRY and REGIMENT CAVALRY units can re-roll Morale tests.</characteristic>
