          <profiles>
            <profile name="  Move! Move! Move!" id="51d4-dee1-9241-4f54" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">PLATOON</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Movement Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT INFANTRY, REGIMENT CAVALRY (6&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">Until the end of your Movement phase, if a eligible unit makes a Normal Move, add 2&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in this unit.
Until the end of your Movement phase, if a eligible unit Advances, do not make an Advance roll. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in the unit.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="  First Rank, Fire! Second Rank, Fire!" id="3476-fe07-805c-c9f2" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">PLATOON</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Shooting Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT INFANTRY (6&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">While this order is in effect, add 1 to the number of attacks made by Assault, Rapid Fire and Pistol weapons from the eligible REGIMENT units (Rapid Fire 1--&gt; Rapid Fire 1+1).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="  Fix bayonets!" id="0103-ee52-09e4-ad89" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">PLATOON</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Charge Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT INFANTRY (6&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">While this order is in effect, add 1 to the Strength characteristic of the attacks made by eligible units with a Combat Knife weapon.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="  Take cover!" id="d239-9d65-a134-9070" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">PLATOON</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Shooting Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT INFANTRY (6&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">Until the end of your next Command phase, ranged attacks against affected REGIMENT units must substract 1 from the hit roll and are ignored for the purposes of determining visibility for models in other units. In addition, add 1 to the saving throw against that attack. REGIMENT units affected by this order cannot shoot Overwatch or Search for Targets. If a unit affected by this ORDER declares a Charge, it stops being affected by this order.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="  Suppression fire!" id="9ee7-ff39-dd3d-ef7d" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">PLATOON</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Shooting Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT INFANTRY, REGIMENT CAVALRY (6&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">If a eligible unit scores 5 or more hits against a enemy unit without INORGANIC, MONSTER or VEHICLE Keywords, then until the end of your opponent’s next turn, that enemy unit is suppressed. While a unit is suppressed, subtract 2&quot; from the Move characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="  Take aim!" id="f27b-8b60-551c-2613" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">PLATOON</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Shooting Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT INFANTRY (6&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">While this order is in effect, each unmodified hit roll of 6 made from ranged weapons of the affected REGIMENT units against units without INORGANIC, VEHICLE or TITANIC Keywords, automatically wounds the target.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="  Heads down!" id="a09b-7226-044e-a469" hidden="true" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">PLATOON</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Shooting Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT INFANTRY (6&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">Until the end of the Shooting phase, models of affected REGIMENT units are ignored for the purposes of determining visibility for models in other friendly units.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
        <infoGroup name="Tactica Orders" id="98aa-299d-73de-8825" hidden="true">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="4406-8f72-bc90-8949" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="   At all costs!" id="7e59-364e-5208-9ec4" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">TACTICA</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Command Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT INFANTRY, REGIMENT CAVALRY, REGIMENT RECON</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">Select one Objective Marker. Until your next Command phase, eligible units gains the Objective Secured ability if they are within 6&quot; of that Objective Marker.
If this unit already has this ability, until the end of your next Command phase, for each remaining Wounds of models in this unit count as having an additional wound when determining control of an objective marker.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="   Don&apos;t give up an inch of ground!" id="481a-130c-f0a5-d109" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">TACTICA</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Command Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT INFANTRY</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">Select one Table Quarter. Until your next Command phase, eligible units affected by a terrain feature, are considered to be in a terrain with DEFENSIBLE trait in adition the traits it already has.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="   Block the enemy advance!" id="437b-2ced-92eb-c094" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">TACTICA</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Command Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT VEHICLE</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">Select one Table Quarter. Until your next Command phase, eligible units gains the SACRIFICEABLE trait.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="   Disregard the loses" id="f98a-0b8c-d2fa-c323" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">TACTICA</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Command Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT INFANTRY, REGIMENT CAVALRY, REGIMENT RECON</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">Select one Table Quarter. Until your next Command phase, when a eligible unit is destroyed during that Battle Round, roll a D6, on a 2+ that unit is placed in Strategic Reserves. At the end of the battle, that unit is considered to be destroyed. This order can be issued once per Command phase.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier field="a435-9dd9-7056-398e" type="set" value="Select one Table Quarter. Until your next Command phase, when a eligible unit is destroyed during that Battle Round, roll a D6, on a 2+ that unit is placed in Strategic Reserves. At the end of the battle, that unit is considered to be destroyed.">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="b3fc-2bcc-a8ab-78e6" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
        <infoGroup name="Prefectus Orders" id="80ea-0c75-a240-ee08" hidden="true">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="272f-808e-bfb2-23c3" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
                    <condition childId="94ce-1a75-e679-5d02" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
                    <condition childId="d872-459e-3b92-fd8a" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Get back in the fight!" id="3e89-e20a-4d39-7a6a" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">PREFECTUS</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Any phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT INFANTRY, AUXILIA INFANTRY (6&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">Until the start of your next Command phase, this unit is eligible to shoot or charge (but not both) in a turn in which it Fell Back.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Duty and Honour!" id="febe-8526-b494-3ca9" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">PREFECTUS</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Any phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT INFANTRY, AUXILIA INFANTRY (6&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">Until the start of your next Command phase, this unit can still perform actions in a turn in which it Fell Back or Advanced, and it can shoot without any actions it is performing failing.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
        <infoGroup name="Armour Orders" id="eec3-68f8-b83b-ce62" hidden="true">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="9946-33a8-b502-a531" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
                    <condition childId="d872-459e-3b92-fd8a" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <profiles>
            <profile name=" Shock and awe!" id="34ad-b052-b09c-7c31" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">ARMOUR</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Command Phase, Movement Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT VEHICLE (9&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">Select one eligible REGIMENT unit. Until your next Command phase, that unit gain the Objective Secured ability if they are within 6&quot; of a Objective Marker.
If this unit already has this ability, until the end of your next Command phase, for each remaining Wounds of models in this unit count as having an additional wound when determining control of an objective marker.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name=" Blitz them!" id="73d5-1e5f-beb6-e7f3" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">ARMOUR</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Charge Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT VEHICLE (9&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">Until the end of the Charge phase, eligible units can re-roll the charge roll.
Until the end of the subsecuent Fighting phase, if the eligible unit has Charged in the previous Charge phase, add 3 to the Attacks characteristic of the models.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name=" Gunners, kill on sight!" id="f348-e01b-a8d1-d78f" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">ARMOUR</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Shooting Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT VEHICLE (9&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">While this order is in effect, each time a model in this unit makes a ranged attack, re-roll a hit roll of 1.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name=" Pound them to dust!" id="efa8-cfe3-6071-9f88" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">ARMOUR</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Shooting Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT VEHICLE (9&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">While this order is in effect, each time this unit is selected to shoot, for the purposes of determining how many attacks are made by Blast weapons models in this unit are equipped with, double the number of models in the target unit.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name=" Pinning Fire!" id="9ff3-9107-aa72-72dd" hidden="false" typeId="5e51-6902-58a8-00f5" typeName="Order">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="acf4-29e1-933e-277c">ARMOUR</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Phase" typeId="d253-ed5c-1a09-ebd1">Shooting Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Eligible Units" typeId="54d6-e3f7-ad8c-d3a0">REGIMENT VEHICLE (9&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a435-9dd9-7056-398e">If a eligible unit scores 5 or more hits against a enemy unit without INORGANIC, MONSTER or VEHICLE Keywords, then until the end of your opponent’s next turn, that enemy unit is suppressed. While a unit is pinned, subtract 2&quot; from the Move characteristic of models in that unit, and each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from that attack’s hit roll.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
