              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If a friendly ASTRA MILITARUM PSYKER suffers PERILS OF THE WARP within 6&quot; of this model, the friendly ASTRA MILITARUM PSYKER model is destroyed and no further effects apply.</characteristic>
