                <selectionEntry name="1 - Refrain of blazing Piety" id="123b-54ba-df7a-801b" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="c9ad-3c10-adbf-3e62" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Refrain of blazing Piety" id="4142-4c79-0cc9-13bc" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this hymn is inspiring, select one enemy unit that is within 12&quot; of and visible to this PRIEST model. Until the start of your next Command phase, that unit reduces their Leadership characteristic by 2.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="2 - Chorus of Spiritual fortitude" id="f9b6-d5b3-f6f1-acac" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="75b4-60a6-8d4f-b439" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Chorus of Spiritual fortitude" id="4c96-52f5-2265-6336" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this hymn is inspiring, select one friendly REGIMENT INFANTRY or IMPERIUM SERVANT CORE unit within 6&quot; of this PRIEST model.
- If that unit or its models are being affected by any psychic powers manifested by enemy models, the effects of those psychic powers on that unit and its models end.
- Until the start of your next Command phase, that unit and the models it contains are not affected by any psychic power manifested by enemy units.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="3 - Psalm of righterous Smiting" id="e6a7-9e87-ba09-9fc2" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="969b-0796-5103-ec09" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Psalm of righterous Smiting" id="00ba-d6a7-338a-0570" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this hymn is inspiring:
- Until the start of your next Command phase, add 1 to this PRIEST model’s Strength and Attacks characteristics.
- At the end of the Fight phase, if this PRIEST model is in Engagement Range of any enemy units, it can fight one additional time.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="4 - Litany of enduring Faith" id="f4b0-789f-f229-1319" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="700f-3a8c-27e6-325a" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Litany of enduring Faith" id="e6e9-1835-7e1d-cb72" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this hymn is inspiring, select one friendly REGIMENT INFANTRY unit within 6&quot; of this PRIEST model.
Until your next Command phase, each time a model in that unit would lose a wound, roll one D6, on a 5+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="5 - Verse of fervent Loyalty" id="fa8e-610d-d974-7f1a" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="d587-aeaa-c306-7043" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Verse of Verse of fervent Loyalty" id="ad26-7683-4896-d321" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this hymn is inspiring, select one friendly REGIMENT INFANTRY unit within 6&quot; of this PRIEST model.
Until the end of the battle, that unit automaticly pass Morale tests.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="6 - Catechism of Repugnance" id="b4d8-1710-4150-cd60" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="bc13-1252-2229-01c2" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Catechism of Repugnance" id="ed8a-adf6-07b0-6d25" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this hymn is inspiring, select one friendly REGIMENT INFANTRY unit within 6&quot; of this PRIEST model.
Until the end of the battle, each time a model in that unit makes a ranged attack with a laser or bolt weapon:
- An unmodified hit roll of 6 scores an additional hit.
- If the selected unit is within half range of the laser or bolt weapon, make an additional attack with it.
A unit can be affected by this hymn once per battle.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
            </selectionEntryGroup>
          </selectionEntryGroups>
        </selectionEntry>
