                          <profiles>
                            <profile name="Unholy Fortitude" id="11fc-c010-d9ae-4f44" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                              <characteristics>
                                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this WARLORD would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
                              </characteristics>
                            </profile>
                          </profiles>
                        </selectionEntry>
                        <selectionEntry name="3: Hatred incarnate" id="18f0-ed62-aa20-d491" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                          <constraints>
                            <constraint id="5cf3-4ff6-ee4e-bd11" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                            <constraint id="98d7-9059-e60a-0802" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                          </constraints>
                          <costs>
                            <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                            <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                            <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                            <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                          </costs>
                          <profiles>
                            <profile name="Hatred incarnate" id="9d2e-15c3-8290-7b1e" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                              <characteristics>
                                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time this WARLORD fights, if it made a charge move or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, until that fight is resolved, add 1 to the Strength and Attacks characteristics of this WARLORD.
- Each time this WARLORD makes a melee attack, you can re-roll that attack’s hit roll</characteristic>
                              </characteristics>
                            </profile>
                          </profiles>
                        </selectionEntry>
                        <selectionEntry name="4: Lord of Terror" id="2676-267c-158b-8dbf" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                          <constraints>
                            <constraint id="7279-2d27-f6d7-4b7a" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                            <constraint id="fcd1-ab4a-1c08-4007" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                          </constraints>
                          <costs>
                            <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                            <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                            <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                            <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                          </costs>
                          <profiles>
                            <profile name="Lord of Terror [Aura]" id="c3eb-2aae-8f31-65cb" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                              <characteristics>
                                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While an enemy unit is within 6&quot; of this WARLORD:
- Each time a Morale test is taken for that unit, your opponent must roll one additional D6 and discard the lowest result.
- If that unit fails a Morale test, until the end of the phase, it is considered to be below Half-strength for the purposes of Combat Attrition tests.</characteristic>
                              </characteristics>
                            </profile>
                          </profiles>
                        </selectionEntry>
                        <selectionEntry name="5: Eternal vendetta" id="490a-0eee-b9a6-d0c9" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                          <constraints>
                            <constraint id="6e1c-4374-4e7b-2f7a" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                            <constraint id="06dd-c448-cfab-ea3e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                          </constraints>
                          <costs>
                            <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                            <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                            <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                            <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                          </costs>
                          <profiles>
                            <profile name="Eternal vendetta" id="6ff9-b874-395f-5b7e" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                              <characteristics>
                                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the first battle round, before the first turn begins, select one enemy unit. 
Until the end of the battle, while a friendly &lt;LEGION&gt; CORE or &lt;LEGION&gt; CHARACTER unit is within 9&quot; of this WARLORD, each time a model in that &lt;LEGION&gt; unit makes an attack against that enemy unit, you can re-roll that attack’s wound roll.
If the selected unit is destroyed, you can select another unit.</characteristic>
                              </characteristics>
                            </profile>
                          </profiles>
                        </selectionEntry>
                        <selectionEntry name="6: Gaze of the Gods" id="788c-688e-7ded-0d79" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                          <constraints>
