                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">This model has a transport capacity of 150 ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY models, 4 VEHICLE models without the FLY keyword and 2 VEHICLE models with the FLY keyword.
Each Heavy Weapon Team or Veteran Heavy Weapon Team model takes the space of 2 INFANTRY models and each OGRYN model takes the space of 3 INFANTRY models, and each VEHICLE model of 10 or more Wounds characteristic takes the space of 2 VEHICLE models.
This TRANSPORT cannot embark DEATHSTRIKE or TITANIC models.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                      <modifiers>
