              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a ranged attack is made against this model, if the attacker is more than 18&quot; away, this model is treated as having the benefits of Dense Cover against that attack. In addition, if the attacker is more than 24&quot; away, this model is treated as having the benefits of Light Cover against that attack.</characteristic>
